DESCRIPTION:National Coming Out Day is observed on October 11\, and has bee
 n since 1988. The date is not arbitrary: it is the anniversary of the Seco
 nd National March on Washington for Lesbian and Gay Rights\, held October 
 11\, 1987\, the weekend the AIDS Memorial Quilt was unfolded in full for t
 he first time. The day was built on a single premise one of its founders k
 ept repeating\, that most people who believe they know no gay person are w
 rong.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-coming-out-day/
